OL,3,AWhat is the triple lock and why are
OL,4,Apeople talking about it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has announced plans
OL,7,Fto scrap the existing triple lock
OL,8,Farrangement for the state pension in
OL,9,Forder to help fund a new plan for
OL,10,Fsocial care.
OL,12,FThe triple lock currently guarantees
OL,13,Fthat the state pension goes up each
OL,14,Fyear in line with either inflation,
OL,15,Fwage increases, or 2.5% ` whichever is
OL,16,Fthe highest.
OL,18,FAndy Burnham said he would honour the
OL,19,Fpledge given in Labour's 2024 manifesto
OL,20,Fto keep the triple lock unchanged in
OL,21,Fthe current Parliament.
OL,23,APub: 17-JunQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
