OL,3,AWhat is the triple lock and why are
OL,4,Apeople talking about it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the PM said that from April
OL,7,F2030 the arrangement will change, with
OL,8,Fthe state pension rising every year at
OL,9,Fleast by inflation or 2.5%.
